    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-lūco</span></b> , āre,
			v. a.
		lux, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to let the light through</i> a tree by clearing it of its
			useless branches; <i>to lop</i> or <i>thin</i> a tree (Plinian): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interlucata densitate ramorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 23, 35, § 214</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					17, 12, 19, § 94</span></i>
			.</div>
